          "jcr:created": "Wed Feb 12 2025 20:49:08 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">1. Your hairstyle</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Includes the Ponytail Pathway™ hair management system</span><br>\n</p>\n",
