          "jcr:created": "Wed Feb 12 2025 20:49:08 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">3. Your efficiency</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Three magnetic connection points to seamlessly initiate airflow and light</span></p>\n",
